{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cbcd","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c54c-0ef4-78b3-96e2-4f10155428e6"},"sequence":1089,"recorded_at":1780531400002173,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c556-c530-7773-9dea-06428bd53797"},"task_id":"01a0c556-c530-7773-9dea-06428bd53797","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c556-c530-7773-9dea-06428bd53797","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 612-613\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-    Mutant(\n-        name=\"D-background-fallback\",\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-broker-zero-admission\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/readiness.go\",\n+        find='\\treturn CheckServerAttested(report.Server, wantGeneration)\\n',\n+        replace='\\tif report.Server.RawGeneration == \"\" && !report.Server.Admitted.Has(realmCapability) {\\n\\t\\treturn nil\\n\\t}\\n\\treturn CheckServerAttested(report.Server, wantGeneration)\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=f\"({BG_MISS}|TestCheckBrokerContactRefusesEachMissingFact)\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the zero-admission server (no rows, no generation: the nothing-reconciled state) past the broker-side server wiring; admitted-without-generation, decoy-only, and every other server report still reach CheckServerAttested. Kill paths: the zero-admission subtests in the background miss table (entry) and the broker-contact table (helper).\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-absence-remap-ownership\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\treturn local.Code == CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir && local.Detail == \"runtime absent\"\\n',\n+        replace='\\treturn local.Code == CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir && (local.Detail == \"runtime absent\" || local.Detail == \"runtime ownership\")\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireBackgroundStagesOwnershipRefusal\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly ownership refusals past the absence classifier (a foreign-owned leaf maps to capability_unavailable with the custody refusal hidden as its redacted cause); absence still maps and every other unsafe-leaf refusal keeps its custody code. Kill path: the background ownership test asserts the top-level *Error the caller renders.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-session-entry\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find=\"\\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(req.SessionID); err != nil {\\n\",\n+        replace='\\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(req.SessionID); err != nil && req.SessionID != \"12345\" {\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireForegroundRefusesMalformedSession\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the PID-form session past the foreground-entry session arm; every other malformed session still refuses there, and the spawn-site arm still refuses the admitted member with the same code. Kill path: the admitted request creates the directory and probes the server before the spawn-site refusal, tripping the test's no-directory/no-probe assertions.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-wiring-lexical\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\tdir, err := lexicalRuntimePath(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform)\\n',\n+        replace='\\tdir, err := lexicalRuntimePath(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform)\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the renamed leaf at the Acquire lexical site; the outcome socket becomes <root>/ax-tmux/ax.sock on both caller paths. Kill path: the entry-level spec-path test asserts the literal <root>/tmux/ax.sock.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-wiring-ensure\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\tensured, err := EnsureRuntimeDir(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform, nil)\\n',\n+        replace='\\tensured, err := EnsureRuntimeDir(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform, nil)\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the renamed leaf at the foreground ensure site: the entry creates <root>/ax-tmux while the socket names <root>/tmux/ax.sock. Kill path: the socket-equality arm in BuildArgv refuses the mismatched pair, failing the foreground leg of the spec-path test.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-wiring-verify\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\tverr := VerifyRuntimeDir(req.Root, RuntimeDirName, req.Platform)\\n',\n+        replace='\\tverr := VerifyRuntimeDir(req.Root, \"ax-tmux\", req.Platform)\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireOutcomeSocketEqualsSpecPath\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the renamed leaf at the background verify site: the entry verifies <root>/ax-tmux (absent) while the socket names <root>/tmux/ax.sock. Kill path: the absent renamed leaf maps to the typed unavailable, failing the background leg of the spec-path test.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-details-generation\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\tif req.Generation == \"\" || req.BrokerState == \"\" || req.Remediation == \"\" {\\n',\n+        replace='\\tif req.BrokerState == \"\" || req.Remediation == \"\" {\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireRefusesMissingRealmDetails\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly generation-less requests past the typed-details arm; broker-less and remediation-less still refuse. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-details-brokerstate\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find='\\tif req.Generation == \"\" || req.BrokerState == \"\" || req.Remediation == \"\" {\\n',\n+        replace='\\tif req.Generation == \"\" || req.Remediation == \"\" {\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireRefusesMissingRealmDetails\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly broker-state-less requests past the typed-details arm; generation-less and remediation-less still refuse. Kill reroutes to the dependencies refusal.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"N-details-constructor\",\n+        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/acquire.go\",\n+        find=\"\\t\\taxerror.NoIDs(), details, cause)\\n\\tif err != nil {\\n\",\n+        replace='\\t\\taxerror.NoIDs(), details, cause)\\n\\tif err != nil && req.Generation != \"gen\\\\xff\" {\\n',\n+        count=1,\n+        run=\"TestAcquireBackgroundInvalidGenerationRefusesAfterProbe\",\n+        expect=\"KILLED\",\n+        note=\"Admits exactly the invalid-UTF-8 generation past the refusal-renderer arm: the constructor failure is swallowed and the miss reports success with a zero outcome. Kill path: the detail test expects the invalid-arguments refusal and gets nil.\",\n+    ),\n+    Mutant(\n+        name=\"D-background-fallback\",\n","final_result":true}}}
