would reroute it to `runtime root`, refusal-to-refusal. Reported\n+  as error-arm rows, never counted among the narrowing survivors.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2t4g7i/worktree/internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md","added":12,"removed":10},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
