im. An `ax` invocation from\n+  inside its own AX pane refuses `ambient collision` when the caller\n+  populates Ambient from the process environment\n+  (TMUX=`<derived>`,pid,idx in the real encoding): over-strict\n+  rather than over-permissive, and the caller owns what it observes\n+  — the lifecycle leaf TASK-260830-1c28dz decides the\n+  nested-invocation rule deliberately.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2t4g7i/worktree/internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md","added":16,"removed":11},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d46f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c54c-0ef4-78b3-96e2-4f10155428e6"},"sequence":2194,"recorded_at":1780531400004383,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a845ab6a-f3a6-48e7-a9d4-e4e3621097f9"},"call_id":"call_01a0c567ec187217940b40e81a6f1b72","text":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 192-196\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-  and spawn through the built argv, and the server socket's crash\n-  evidence, are owned by the lifecycle leaf TASK-260830-1c28dz. The\n-  no-fallback proof covers spawns routed through Dependencies.Spawn;\n-  a fallback through a direct os/exec call is excluded today only by\n-  the import census (no os/exec import in the package).\n+  and spawn through the built argv, and the server socket's crash\n+  evidence, are owned by the lifecycle leaf TASK-260830-1c28dz. The\n+  no-fallback proof covers spawns routed through Dependencies.Spawn;\n+  a fallback through a direct os/exec call is excluded today only by\n+  the import census (no os/exec import in the package).\n+  Dependencies.Spawn is inert on the background path: a nil spawner\n+  with a live broker still contacts (the broker path never calls it),\n+  so the field is dead weight there — which is what makes the\n+  shared-Dependencies fallback shape realistic, and why the spy\n+  census arms the foreground probe alongside the spawner.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-2t4g7i/worktree/internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md","added":10,"removed":5},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
